            "review_title": "Review at Bo Steak House",
            "review_text": "Blaine\nBai Chay, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nAmazing food for the price!\nApr 2024 • Family\nWe were brought to this restaurant by our grab driver after asking for a good burger or steak house. \nThe staff was really nice and the food was exceptional.\nHad a bottle of wine, a burger, and the steak combo(which included a soup and dessert of the day). The soup included with the combo was okay but the beef was all gristle. The steak was perfectly done and the burger was huge with tons of cheese and cooked very well. \nWould definitely recommend! \nTotal cost of the meal was 850000vnd.\nRead more\nWritten April 20, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
