            "review_text": "Max\nDa Nang, Vietnam292 contributions\n0\nLovely place\nJan 2023\nWe enjoyed our beef Wellington here. It came with a side salad, fries and spaghetti bolognese, so it's pretty good value. Only down side was we had to wait almost an hour for it, even though we were told it would only take 30 mins. They served us a nice meatball while we waited though:-)\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 9, 2023",
